WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.163 line:82%
Chapter 19. Find any page fast, and start your class in two clicks.

00:00:06.575 --> 00:00:12.482 line:82%
Can't find a page? Press "Find", at the top of the menu, or press Control and K.

00:00:12.943 --> 00:00:19.983 line:82%
Type a few letters. It finds pages, lessons, games, classes, students, and answers from the help.

00:00:20.446 --> 00:00:23.783 line:82%
Press Enter, or click a result, to open it.

00:00:24.244 --> 00:00:26.582 line:82%
A student's name works too.

00:00:28.072 --> 00:00:35.524 line:82%
Or press the microphone, and say the name of a page, like "attendance". On the laptop, it works with no internet.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:41.262 line:82%
At the top of each page, the path shows where you are. Press "Back" to go back.

00:00:41.715 --> 00:00:48.403 line:82%
Use a page often? Press the star. The page goes to "My pages", in the menu and on Home.

00:00:48.865 --> 00:00:54.602 line:82%
On Home, "My pages" and "Recent" open the pages you used, in one click.

00:00:55.067 --> 00:01:05.623 line:82%
Keyboard: one letter opens a page. H is Home, L is Lessons, A is Attendance, R is Results. Press the question mark to see all the keys.

00:01:06.086 --> 00:01:12.842 line:82%
And the "Start class" box on Home: first take attendance, then start the next test. One click each.
